        "title": "Data Output Results",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p><strong>Label</strong><br/><strong>Printing:</strong> Output of measurement results on one or two levels using a ZOLLER label printer.</p> <p><strong>Report</strong><br/><strong>printing:</strong> Output of the measurement report as a printout on a laser printer or as a PDF file, including an editing function.</p> <p><strong>Measurement Data Export</strong><br/><strong>:</strong> Automatic export of measurement data in CSV format.</p>",
